          "start_ms": null,
          "text": "Témoignages: BEAUNE-D'ALLIER (03) 30.04.1990 T2 BEAUNE-D'ALLIER (03) 30.04.1990 T3 BEAUNE-D'ALLIER (03) 30.04.1990 T1",
          "text_sha256": "623e256ac0e99529621d446e09e18a243e867783c443e007ae69a093f596985d"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
